1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
Every season, a stylist gets
hundreds of runway screenshots.

2
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:08,610
This is PULL — the whole job,
from screenshots to signed-off looks.

3
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,400
Drop in the folder.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:15,220
The agent reads every caption
and trims it.

5
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:19,440
Every look is filed under its house,
ready to shortlist.

6
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:23,260
Nothing is published until you say so.

7
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:28,910
Send one link. Your client opens it
with no account, no app.

8
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:32,730
They approve what they love,
and pass the rest.

9
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:38,590
And they can circle the exact piece
they want, right on the look.

10
00:00:38,890 --> 00:00:42,000
That markup comes back to your board.

11
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:47,240
From the approvals, the agent drafts
one email per showroom.

12
00:00:47,540 --> 00:00:51,460
Every approved look, the shoot dates,
the ship-to address.

13
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:55,280
You read it, edit it, and approve it.

14
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:59,100
Nothing leaves the studio
until you approve it.

15
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:03,520
The studio is where ZooWork
does the heavy lifting.

16
00:01:03,820 --> 00:01:08,970
Four references, and a border
you drew around one of them.

17
00:01:09,270 --> 00:01:14,420
The ZooWork agent reads the pictures
and writes the edit prompt.

18
00:01:14,720 --> 00:01:18,640
GPT Image 2 renders the look —
ZooWork's image model.

19
00:01:18,940 --> 00:01:21,640
Vision and image, both from ZooWork.

20
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:27,500
Every call is mirrored to PRISM,
with the model and the latency.

21
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:31,520
The suggestions start from
the client's own record.

22
00:01:31,820 --> 00:01:34,930
What they wore, and for which house.

23
00:01:35,230 --> 00:01:41,190
Then eight looks from each house's runway,
each collection linked to its source.

24
00:01:41,690 --> 00:01:46,020
Every tool call and every model call,
in the open.

25
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:49,840
Models by ZooWork.
Traces by PRISM.

26
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:53,660
PULL. From screenshots
to signed-off looks.
